msgid "Overview of available IBM Quantum Functions for managing noise in workloads."
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya ng mga available na IBM Quantum Functions para sa pamamahala ng noise sa mga workload."

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit functions"
msgstr "Circuit functions"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit functions {#circuit-functions}"
msgstr "Circuit functions {#circuit-functions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit functions simplify the execution of quantum circuits by abstracting away key steps such as transpilation, error suppression, and error mitigation. Researchers using Circuit functions can focus on developing and evaluating quantum algorithms without needing to manage the complexities of optimizing circuits for quantum hardware. Circuit functions accept circuit-oriented inputs, such as PUB (Primitive Unified Bloc) objects, and return results such as mitigated expectation values. They can also serve as building blocks for creating higher-level, customized quantum applications.\n"
msgstr "Pinapasimple ng Circuit functions ang pagpapatakbo ng mga quantum circuit sa pamamagitan ng pag-abstract ng mahahalagang hakbang tulad ng transpilation, error suppression, at error mitigation. Ang mga researcher na gumagamit ng Circuit functions ay makakapag-focus sa pagbuo at pag-evaluate ng mga quantum algorithm nang hindi kailangang pamahalaan ang mga kumplikadong aspeto ng pag-optimize ng mga circuit para sa quantum hardware. Tumatanggap ang Circuit functions ng mga circuit-oriented na input, tulad ng mga PUB (Primitive Unified Bloc) object, at nagbabalik ng mga resulta tulad ng mga mitigated na expectation value. Magagamit din ang mga ito bilang building block para sa paggawa ng mas mataas na antas at customized na quantum application.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"IBM Quantum Functions are an experimental feature available only to IBM Quantum&reg; Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (via IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users. Refer to [Set up IBM Quantum Functions](/guides/functions-get-started) for instructions on getting access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga Tala\">\n"
"Ang IBM Quantum Functions ay isang experimental na feature na available lamang sa mga user ng IBM Quantum&reg; Premium Plan, Flex Plan, at On-Prem (sa pamamagitan ng IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan. Tingnan ang [Set up IBM Quantum Functions](/guides/functions-get-started) para sa mga tagubilin sa pagkuha ng access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

